# Test: a filter narrows the devices table, survives a reload, and a row
#       opens the side panel
# VALIDATES: spec-fleet-ui-1 user story 3 and AC-4 -- the filter is in the
#            address, so the address reproduces the view; the eye control of
#            a row opens its details in the side panel
# PREVENTS: a query row that filters without writing the address, a reload
#           that loses the filter, an eye control that opens nothing
#
# Goal: prove the devices table's filter and side panel work in a browser.
# Method: the sample estate has 44 devices, four of them route servers
# (rs-lon-01, rs-ams-01, rs-fra-01, rs-par-01: sample/estate.go, and the role
# counts of TestSampleEstateInvariants). Labels never change under the
# sample script, so the counts hold whenever its timer steps. The test types
# role:route-server into the query row and submits it, then reads the count
# line and the address; opens that same address again, which is the reload;
# then opens rs-fra-01's details with its eye control and reads the side
# panel and the address. Every assertion on the table reads the content
# region alone, so the tree's names cannot answer for it.

option=needs-build-tag:value=ze_fleet_ui_sample:state=present
option=timeout:value=90s
option=viewport:width=1600:height=1000

action=open:path=/fleet/estate/devices/
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=44 of 44 devices
action=fill:id=fleet-devices-filter:value=role:route-server
action=press:id=fleet-devices-filter:key=Enter
expect=url:contains=q=role%3Aroute-server
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=4 of 44 devices
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=rs-fra-01
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=edge-lon-01

# The reload: the address alone must rebuild the filtered view.
action=open:path=/fleet/estate/devices/?q=role%3Aroute-server
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=4 of 44 devices
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=value="role:route-server"
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=edge-lon-01

action=click:text=Show the details of rs-fra-01
expect=url:contains=id=rs-fra-01
expect=url:contains=q=role%3Aroute-server
expect=html:id=fleet-side-panel:contains=rs-fra-01
